msgstr "pincelada elíptica: ratio"

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:193
msgid ""
"aspect ratio of the dabs; must be >= 1.0, where 1.0 means a perfectly round "
"dab. TODO: linearize? start at 0.0 maybe, or log?"
msgstr ""
"proporción de aspecto das pinceladas suaves; ten que ser >= 1.0, onde 1.0 "
"significa perfectamente redondo. Por facer: linearizar? comenzar en 00.0 "
"probablemente ou rexistrar?"

